  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 4496571990016
    m_Localized: Weakened
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4496651681792
    m_Localized: Deals 50% less damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4497024974848
    m_Localized: Thorn Armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4497024974849
    m_Localized: When attacked, deals damage back to the attacker.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4497381490688
    m_Localized: Life Steal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4497381490689
    m_Localized: Recovers part of the damage dealt as HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4497729617920
    m_Localized: Regeneration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4497729617921
    m_Localized: Recovers HP at the start of each turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4498077745152
    m_Localized: Shield
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4498077745153
    m_Localized: Temporary HP that absorbs damage before real HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4498425872384
    m_Localized: Poisoned
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4498425872385
    m_Localized: Takes damage at the start of each turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7824852877312
    m_Localized: Armored
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7824865460224
    m_Localized: Reduces the damage of every hit received.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7825255530496
    m_Localized: Melee
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7825255530497
    m_Localized: Chases you and attacks up close.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7825603657728
    m_Localized: Swarm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7825603657729
    m_Localized: Fragile and fast, and comes in numbers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7825955979264
    m_Localized: Ranged
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7825955979265
    m_Localized: Attacks from afar and tries to keep its distance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7826312495104
    m_Localized: Support
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7826312495105
    m_Localized: Heals or empowers its allies. A priority target.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7826656428032
    m_Localized: Summoner
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7826656428033
    m_Localized: Summons new enemies during the battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7827000360960
    m_Localized: Controller
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7827000360961
    m_Localized: Applies negative states to you or moves you around the grid.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7828103462912
    m_Localized: Goblin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7828103462913
    m_Localized: Chases you and attacks up close.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7828103462914
    m_Localized: Slime
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7828103462915
    m_Localized: Slow and sturdy. Advances on you and attacks up close.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7828103462916
    m_Localized: Rat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7828103462917
    m_Localized: Fast and fragile. Closes in quickly and bites.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7828103462918
    m_Localized: Eye Bat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7828103462919
    m_Localized: Fast and fragile. Flits toward you and attacks up close.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7828103462920
    m_Localized: Fire Skull
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7828103462921
    m_Localized: Attacks from a distance and tries to hold that range.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7828212514816
    m_Localized: Goblin Shaman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7828212514817
    m_Localized: Heals and shields injured allies and keeps away from you. Take it out first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7828325761024
    m_Localized: Rat Queen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7828325761025
    m_Localized: Summons rats to fight for her and keeps away from you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7828430618624
    m_Localized: Hexing Eye
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7828430618625
    m_Localized: Weakens you from a distance, then closes in to attack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7828539670528
    m_Localized: Armored Goblin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7828539670529
    m_Localized: Armor blocks part of every hit, so weak attacks barely scratch it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7828652916736
    m_Localized: Regenerating Slime
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7828652916737
    m_Localized: Recovers HP every turn. Deal damage fast, before it heals.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7828757774336
    m_Localized: Thorny Rat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7828757774337
    m_Localized: Hurts whoever hits it. Attack from afar or use damage over time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7840745095168
    m_Localized: Strike
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7840745095169
    m_Localized: A quick strike against an adjacent enemy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7841101611008
    m_Localized: Shield Charge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7841101611009
    m_Localized: Charge with your shield and hit a line of enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7841487486976
    m_Localized: Fireball
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7841487486977
    m_Localized: Hurl a fireball that burns every enemy in an area, from anywhere on the grid.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7841844002816
    m_Localized: Frost Nova
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7841844002817
    m_Localized: A burst of frost that hits enemies around the target.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7842200518656
    m_Localized: Lightning Storm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7842200518657
    m_Localized: Lightning that spreads out in a cone from the target.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7842586394624
    m_Localized: Throwing Dagger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7842586394625
    m_Localized: Throw a dagger at a distant enemy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7842947104768
    m_Localized: Smoke Bomb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7842947104769
    m_Localized: Throw a smoke bomb at an enemy next to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7843299426304
    m_Localized: Poisoned Dagger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7843299426305
    m_Localized: A poisoned dagger that pierces a line of enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7843660136448
    m_Localized: Poison Line
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7843660136449
    m_Localized: A long trail of poison that hits every enemy in a line.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10290159910912
    m_Localized: Your first battle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10290247991296
    m_Localized: 'Tap a highlighted cell to move or an enemy in range to attack; each action gives the enemies a turn. Defeating them gives XP: fill the bar to level up.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10290373820416
    m_Localized: Choose your path
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10290373820417
    m_Localized: 'Tap a node to preview it: its type and, for battles, the XP, the enemy roles and the terrain. Then confirm to enter.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10290495455232
    m_Localized: Level up!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10290495455233
    m_Localized: 'The game is paused: pick 1 of 3 talents to shape your build. You can also reroll the offer, ban a talent or skip it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10290604507136
    m_Localized: Health carries over
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10290604507137
    m_Localized: Your HP carries over to the next battle. It only recovers at heal nodes or through your build, so keep an eye on it when planning your route.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10290717753344
    m_Localized: Heal node
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10290717753345
    m_Localized: Here you recover HP. Plan your route so you reach one before your HP runs out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10290826805248
    m_Localized: Talent node
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10290826805249
    m_Localized: Here you can get a talent outside of leveling up, at a cost. Make sure the price is worth it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10290944245760
    m_Localized: Consumables
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10290944245761
    m_Localized: Consumables are single use and only work in battle. Using one does not spend your action, but you can use only one per turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10291057491968
    m_Localized: Details
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10291057491969
    m_Localized: 'Long press (right click on PC) a character to see its attributes, skills and active states. It never uses your turn: close the window with the X.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10291187515392
    m_Localized: Skills
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10291187515393
    m_Localized: Tap a skill button, then a highlighted cell to use it; tap the button again to cancel. Skills have a cooldown counted in your actions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141742633615360
    m_Localized: Healing Potion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141742713307136
    m_Localized: Restores 30 HP. Using it does not cost your action.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141743153709056
    m_Localized: Bomb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141743153709057
    m_Localized: 'Throw it up to 3 cells away: deals 15 damage to every enemy in a 3x3 area. Does not cost your action.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141743547973632
    m_Localized: Regeneration Tonic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141743547973633
    m_Localized: Recover health over time for 3 turns. Does not cost your action.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 142151209156608
    m_Localized: Rock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 142151209156609
    m_Localized: 'Rubble blocks the way: nobody can stand on it or cross it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 142151704084480
    m_Localized: Fire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 142151704084481
    m_Localized: Burns whoever ends their turn on it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 142152127709184
    m_Localized: Poison Bog
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 142152127709185
    m_Localized: Poisons whoever ends their turn on it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 142152563916800
    m_Localized: Healing Shrine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 142152563916801
    m_Localized: Grants Regeneration to whoever ends their turn on it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 142153050456064
    m_Localized: Ward Stone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 142153050456065
    m_Localized: Grants a Shield to whoever ends their turn on it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 151679795429376
    m_Localized: Goblin King
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 151679891898368
    m_Localized: 'Placeholder final boss: a goblin king stronger than any goblin.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 151679891898369
    m_Localized: Charges you and hits hard. Comes with two armored guards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 151680038699008
    m_Localized: Goblin Guard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 151680038699009
    m_Localized: Placeholder escort of the final boss. Armored.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 151680038699010
    m_Localized: Chases you and attacks up close. Takes less damage from every hit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
